1
00:00:00,864 --> 00:00:02,994
(Sheldon:)with my driver Ganesh.

2
00:00:04,234 --> 00:00:06,534
(Penny:)Fine.

3
00:00:06,537 --> 00:00:08,137
Oh, thanks!
You're a peach!

4
00:00:08,138 --> 00:00:09,338
(Sheldon:)Beverly, we'll
catch up soon.

5
00:00:09,339 --> 00:00:10,639
(Sheldon:)Bernadette, it was
a pleasure as always,

6
00:00:10,641 --> 00:00:12,211
(Sheldon:)Penny, you have
spinach in your teeth.

7
00:00:12,209 --> 00:00:14,239
(door closes)

8
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:17,544
(Penny:)How long have I had spinach
in my teeth?

9
00:00:17,548 --> 00:00:19,018
(Beverly:)Since the airport, dear.

10
00:00:22,286 --> 00:00:26,056
(Howard:)You look like you come
with a kickstand.

11
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:28,356
(Raj:)You can't make me feel bad.

12
00:00:28,358 --> 00:00:30,658
(Howard:)Hmm, maybe not. Leonard?

13
00:00:30,661 --> 00:00:33,531
(Leonard:)So, when the aliens
brought you back,

14
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:35,900
(Leonard:)they just left the probe in?

15
00:00:36,867 --> 00:00:38,797
(Sheldon:)I'm back.

16
00:00:38,802 --> 00:00:40,772
(Leonard:)Hey, how'd it go?
It went well.

17
00:00:40,771 --> 00:00:42,601
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I've learned that
if you never say you're sorry,

18
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:46,206
(Sheldon:)the times you do really
puts them on their heels.

19
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:48,780
(Sheldon:)Uh, Stuart, I relieve you
of your line duties.

20
00:00:48,779 --> 00:00:51,079
(Stuart:)Anyone else need
anything before I go?

21
00:00:51,081 --> 00:00:54,081
(Howard:)I'll give you a dollar
if make fun of Raj.

22
00:00:54,084 --> 00:00:56,554
(Stuart:)That's mean.
Five.

23
00:00:56,553 --> 00:01:01,023
(Stuart:)You look like Tigger
if Tigger looked like a jackass.

